      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not sure I understand why we need this class.\n\nThe purpose of TraceTimer is to record a performance log entry and to add debug logs for the start and end of the operation.\n\nThe metric times report the execution to Gerrit\u0027s MetricMaker, but additionally also already record a performance log entry and add the same debug logs for the start and end of the operation.\n\nWhat is CombinedTraceAndMetricTimer doing additionally?",
